Task: asgard-multimedia
Section: user
Description: Multimedia playback and capture
 Adds the GNOME multimedia app stack: totem and rhythmbox for
 video and music playback, gnome-music as an alternative library
 browser, gnome-sound-recorder for quick audio capture, shotwell
 for photo management, cheese for webcam, plus rygel for UPnP /
 DLNA media serving.  Patent-encumbered codec packages are NOT
 pulled in — install gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly separately if
 needed.  Selecting this task pulls the GNOME desktop set.
